---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy — Splattanooga"
  description="Privacy Policy for Splattanooga"
>
  <header class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-container">
      <a href="/" class="brand-logo">splattanooga</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/#search-widget">Learn More</a>
        <a href="/#about">About</a>
        <a href="mailto:rob@splattanooga.com">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="page-container">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: September 21, 2026</p>
    
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Search Preference Widget — Data Policy</h2>
      <p><strong>What we collect:</strong> Nothing!</p>
      <p>By default, this widget stores only two things on your device:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Your preferred search engine</strong> (in your browser's local storage)</li>
        <li><strong>Your preferred search question</strong> (in your browser's local storage)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This preference is:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>✅ Stored only on your device</li>
        <li>✅ Never sent to our servers</li>
        <li>✅ Never sold or shared</li>
        <li>✅ Cleared when you clear your browser data</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, You can contact us:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>By email: <a href="mailto:rob@splattanooga.com">rob@splattanooga.com</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-links">
      <a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vQMXDCuW_JNd8BSX4dcvETfEPcR3Fz2oGRHp8ZmXq72x8PSdI2u78S0WWxOEfQyL0RskgGHXwRwUPC-/pub" 
         target="_blank" 
         rel="noopener noreferrer">Survey Report ↗</a>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
    </div>
    <p>© 2026 Splattanooga. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg-dark: #0f1115;
    --bg-surface: #15181e;
    --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    --border-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    --text-main: #f4f4f0;
    --text-muted: #8a8f98;
    --accent: hsl(25, 100%, 50%);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  
  body {
    background-color: var(--bg-dark);
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .brand-logo {
    font-family: var(--font-flavors);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, var(--accent) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    text-decoration: none;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .navbar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(15, 17, 21, 0.9);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
  }

  .nav-container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  nav { display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }

  nav a, .footer-links a {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  nav a:hover, .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }

  .page-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    min-height: 70vh;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, var(--accent) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .page-container > p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .content h2 {
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .content p, .content ul {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  
  .content ul {
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .content a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .content a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    justify-content: center;
  }
</style>
